{"server":"cn","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_07_beg","groupId":"act41side","stageId":"act41side_07","title":"烧灯者","storyCode":"EA-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"54ba75e2bef158c59a98ea8a28e182f6bb39cc198b3d299f6bd5da3bd83f1657","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"爱布拉娜倒下，城中的紫火却越烧越烈，拉芙希妮、涅梅丝、布莉吉，三个人各自行动起来......第二个故事到此结束。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“领袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小丘郡还有多远？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"远着呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“领袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐她......不会不知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，只有“雄辩家”那帮人以为事情天衣无缝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“领袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你还跟着我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有得选，我也想美美在之前的营地里睡一觉啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“领袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐为什么不阻止我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。说不定对你寄予厚望吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“领袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，她从来没对我露出过那样的眼神。在我同意做她的影子之后，她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“领袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿赫茉妮，我请求你......我请求你去告诉姐姐，我不想这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想去小丘郡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“领袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。还有，如果姐姐心情还不错的话，我还想请你告诉她，从今以后，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“领袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“领袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我就勉为其难替你传这个话。“雄辩家”的眼线还挺难躲的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“领袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，谢谢，请你快些去吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“领袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在姐姐......彻底厌倦之前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g12_castlecorridor_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"死去的红龙躺在地上。\n活着的红龙身后，离群的守灵人刚刚明白一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g15_castlebalcony_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她骗了您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，她没有欺骗任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她算准了您不愿让整座城市的人为她陪葬，所以才自导自演了这么一出戏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她引诱您刺穿她的躯壳，而她自己则得以摆脱束缚，让本来还没那么凶猛的紫火能在夏末节前夜把所有人烧光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她为什么要为了一个平时从来不放在眼里的节日......冒这样的风险？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红龙，我也是身染紫火的活人，就连我也感受得到，死火正在我胸口燃烧，比任何时候都冰冷，冷得我马上就要失去知觉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管她现在是在图谋整个塔拉，还是她已经疯了，只想拉着一城的人跟她一起死，怎样都好，这些根本就不重要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，塔拉已经是她的囊中之物，她也绝对没有疯，那她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅丝，她的尸首还在吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"离群守灵人的眉毛拧成一团。也许她这辈子还没生出过这么大的恶意，自然也就没下过这么大的决心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的尸首就在——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的回答声被熊熊的燃烧声盖了过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管她究竟要做什么，纳斯尔纱还没有燃尽，还火仪式仍然办得下去......必须要办下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白您的意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去告诉城里人这个消息。告诉他们，那条被他们奉若神明的邪恶的红龙已经死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布莉吉呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经拜托她离开城市，去找守灵人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你该怎么告诉其他人爱布拉娜已经死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拖棺。那条红龙应得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然城里连棺材都快不够了，但她毕竟不是什么死在街头的无名小卒，她配得上一副。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不愿意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我只是第一次意识到，爱布拉娜究竟走在一条多么丑陋的道路上。现在这条路正向我招手，而我......别无选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，涅梅丝，我会为你争取时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"争取时间，您是说黑雾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。如果黑雾看准了夏末节，非要进城来凑热闹，我会拖住它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高尚的红龙","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经等不及要向黑雾请教，该如何让红龙的火光归于黑暗了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我已经等不及要向黑雾请教，该如何让红龙的火光归于黑暗了。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"按照这样的发展，镜中人和红龙的结局已经呼之欲出了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"可作家腾的一声站起身来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底是谁，你到底要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"补全您不愿意讲完的故事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您不是觉得我是那种喜欢“拼凑真相”的家伙吗？我们离真相已经很近很近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了，我得走了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果您无论如何都不愿意由自己来讲出那个结局，那就还是由我来把故事补完，怎么样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看到您一直在瞥那边的报刊栏了。报纸可不一定只报道事实，先生。"},{"type":"narration","text":"作家瞟了一眼酒馆门口。\n他想象了一下自己拔腿跑出酒馆的场景。很滑稽，滑稽到他自己差点笑出来。\n如果报纸没有“报道事实”，那他终于知道这个人是谁了。至于她为什么来找自己，理由也很好猜。\n总之，自己是无论如何都跑不掉的。\n但他同时也意识到一件事。\n也许，他真的可以找到某个如他所愿的结局。\n不管她到底是谁，只要还在聊故事，他们就是平等的。\n他觉得刚才那股颓丧劲儿正在消退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，我现在不管你是谁，也不管你到底要来做什么，但故事就不该这么写。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是给一个没结尾的故事延续了一截，结局仍然付之阙如。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我问你，你看见了......一条红龙杀死另一条的场景？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就和您看见英雄将红龙的骨架拖上广场一样，“创作”，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就对你的创作负责。镜子里的红龙失手让另一个自己在篝火中烧死，然后呢？人们做了什么？躲回镜子里的红龙呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您呢？您就没什么想法？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"作家久违地从口袋里摸出钢笔，又从桌上抓起一张纸牌。他想写下点什么，但钢笔太久没用，已经干了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还需要......一点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，连得上，连得上......也许能连得上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"连得上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我猜，您想说的，是您出版的最后一个故事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"作家的钢笔在纸牌上狠狠划过，终于有一丝墨水渗了出来。\n“愿死亡将我们与一切传奇相连”，这句西莫·威廉姆斯的话突然闯进了他的脑海。\n西莫·威廉姆斯已经死了，而自己也许......真的能不揣冒昧地......与他书写的传奇相连。\n他想把这句诗在纸牌上扒拉出来，但钢笔尖只在纸上留下了几道断裂到无法辨认的墨迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"作家坐回了椅子上，甚至比刚才坐得更直了一些。\n他突然感受到某种冲动，和他第一次听见西莫·威廉姆斯的诗时类似的冲动。\n那让他一路沦落至此，但他至今仍记得的，那种紧紧捏住他的胸腹，让他迫不及待想歌唱、想呐喊——\n想创作的冲动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许你的确替我解决了一些问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，我看见的、我相信的、我说出口的，彼此全都背道而驰。但拜你所赐，它们似乎终于有了一点融为一体的迹象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那真是再好不过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么，您可以开始讲述第三个故事了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然......当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅如此，我还需要你的协助，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我卡壳的时候，我需要你来讲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的故事，但也是你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作家","speakerId":"avg_npc_1698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从一开始就是你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乐意效劳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"作家的呼吸急促，脸上泛起激动的潮红。钢笔无论怎么划也没法正常写字，他干脆把那玩意儿往桌子上一摔。\n是了，是了。\n那些事情，他见得还不够多吗？\n又能怎么样呢？\n他是个作家，他马上就要为自己的故事找到结局。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
